#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\textit{Every move could be your last. Every gate a~gamble. Glory belongs to the bold.}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\textit{Chaque pas peut être le dernier. Chaque Porte, un~pari. La gloire revient aux audacieux.}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Scenario Length}}\n"
"Up to 11 or 15 Rounds\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Durée du Scénario}}\n"
"Jusqu'à 11 ou 15 Manches\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Player Setup}}\n"
"\\textbf{Player Count:} 2--6\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Préparation des Joueurs}}\n"
"\\textbf{Nombre de Joueurs :} 2--6\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item A ``Pack'' of chosen \\svg{bronze} Units\n"
"  \\item A chosen Neutral \\svg{bronze} Unit matching the player's Faction\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item «Groupe» d'unités \\svg{bronze} choisies\n"
"  \\item Une Unité Neutre \\svg{bronze} choisie de votre Faction\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item $P$ × Starting (I) Map Tiles\n"
"  \\item $2P$ × Far (II--III) Map Tiles\n"
"  \\item $P$ × Near (IV--V) Map Tiles\n"
"  \\item 6 × Near (IV--V) Map Tiles with an Obelisk\n"
"  \\item 1 × Center (VI--VII) Map Tile\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item $P$ × Tuiles de Départ (I)\n"
"  \\item $2P$ × Tuiles Lointaines (II--III)\n"
"  \\item $P$ × Tuiles Proches (IV--V)\n"
"  \\item 6 × Tuiles Proches (IV--V) avec un Obélisque\n"
"  \\item 1 × Tuile Centre (VI--VII)\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Victory Conditions}}\n"
"The game ends when any of the following conditions are met:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Conditions de Victoire}}\n"
"La partie se termine dès qu'une de ces conditions est remplie :\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item One player has flagged all 6 Obelisks. \\textit{That player wins the game immediately.}\n"
"  \\item \\textbf{4--6 players:} One player has defeated every opponent's Main Hero at least once. \\textit{That player wins the game immediately.}\n"
"  \\item At the end of Round 15.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Un Joueur a revendiqué les 6 Obélisques. \\textit{Il gagne immédiatement.}\n"
"  \\item \\textbf{4--6 Joueurs :} Un Joueur a vaincu au moins une fois le Héros Principal de chaque adversaire. \\textit{Il gagne immédiatement.}\n"
"  \\item À la fin de la Manche 15.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Victory Points}}\n"
"If no player has achieved an immediate victory, the player with the most Victory Points (VP) wins.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Points de Victoire}}\n"
"Sans victoire immédiate, le Joueur ayant le plus de Points de Victoire (VP) l'emporte.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item 4 VPs for the first player to flag the Center VII Field.\n"
"  \\item 2 VPs for each enemy Main Hero defeated.\n"
"  \\item 1 VP for each flagged Obelisk.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item 4 VP pour le premier Joueur à revendiquer la Case Centre VII.\n"
"  \\item 2 VP pour chaque Héros Principal ennemi vaincu.\n"
"  \\item 1 VP pour chaque Obélisque revendiqué.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Timed Events}}\n"
"\\textbf{\\nth{4} Round:}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Remove all Black Cubes from the Map, except those on Learning Stones.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\\textbf{\\nth{6} Round:}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Player(s) whose Main Hero has the least \\svg{experience}, Search (2) \\svg{artifact}.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\\textbf{\\nth{8} Round:}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Repeat the event of Round 4.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\\textbf{\\nth{10} Round:}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Player(s) whose Main Hero has the least \\svg{experience}, roll and resolve \\svg{resource} twice.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\\textbf{\\nth{12} Round:}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Repeat the event of Round 4.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Évènements programmés}}\n"
"\\textbf{Manche 4 :}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Retirez tous les Cubes Noirs du Plateau, sauf ceux sur les Pierres d'Apprentissage.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\\textbf{Manche 6 :}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Le(s) Joueur(s) dont le Héros Principal a le moins d'\\svg{experience} : Fouillez (2) \\svg{artifact}.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\\textbf{Manche 8 :}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Répétez l'évènement de la Manche 4.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\\textbf{Manche 10 :}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Le(s) Joueur(s) dont le Héros Principal a le moins d'\\svg{experience} : lancez et résolvez \\svg{resource} deux fois.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\\textbf{Manche 12 :}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Répétez l'évènement de la Manche 4.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: clash/astral_run.tex:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Additional Rules}}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item The Blocked Field on the Map Tile in the center is not considered blocked.\n"
"  \\item \\textbf{Sanctuary:} Search (2) your Deck. \\textit{Visitable once per Faction}.\n"
"  \\item \\textbf{Obelisk:} Guarded by Level VI Neutral Units. Search (4) \\svg[8]{skill}, \\svg{spellpower} or \\svg{artifact}. \\\\ \\textbf{First to Flag:} Gain Empowered Ability Token.\n"
"  \\item Each \\textbf{blocked Field} adjacent to an Obelisk is a two-way Astral Gate, which only becomes active after that Obelisk has been visited.\n"
"  \\item \\textbf{Astral Gate:} Cannot be entered from a different Map Tile. When a Hero enters an Astral Gate, they are teleported to the Astral Gate on the Near Tile directly opposite the Center Tile. If that Tile is undiscovered, that player immediately discovers it.\n"
"  \\item Gain 1 \\svg{experience} after a Combat against an enemy Main Hero, unless one of the players surrenders or retreats.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{\\MakeUppercase{Règles Additionnelles}}\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item La Case Bloquée sur la Tuile Centre n'est pas considérée comme bloquée.\n"
"  \\item \\textbf{Sanctuaire :} Fouillez (2) votre Deck. \\textit{Visitable une fois par Faction}.\n"
"  \\item \\textbf{Obélisque :} Gardé par des Unités Neutres de Rang VI. Fouillez (4) \\svg[8]{skill}, \\svg{spellpower} ou \\svg{artifact}. \\\\ \\textbf{Premier à Revendiquer :} Gagnez un Jeton de Compétence Renforcée.\n"
"  \\item Chaque \\textbf{Case bloquée} adjacente à un Obélisque est une Porte Astrale à double sens, qui ne devient active qu'une fois cet Obélisque visité.\n"
"  \\item \\textbf{Porte Astrale :} On ne peut pas y entrer depuis une autre Tuile. Lorsqu'un Héros entre dans une Porte Astrale, il est téléporté vers la Porte Astrale de la Tuile Proche directement opposée à la Tuile Centre. Si cette Tuile n'est pas découverte, ce Joueur la découvre immédiatement.\n"
"  \\item Gagnez 1 \\svg{experience} après un Combat contre un Héros Principal ennemi, sauf si l'un des Joueurs se rend ou bat en retraite.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"

